	"VersionName": "0.1",
	"FriendlyName": "GSTN Platform",
	"Description": "Enemies as solid platforms and traversal surfaces: kinematic, unattached colliders (shapes) authored in an enemy's frame, posed at one defined point per simulation step from a function of the simulation frame, with per-shape traversal behaviours (GSTNSurface) and per-shape activation. Fighters only in this version (no minion proxy). Depends on GSTNSurface (Core) and Mover; needs no GAS and no direct Network Prediction code.",
	"Category": "Gameplay",
	"CreatedBy": "xJusteen47",
